// GENERATED by `cargo xtask codegen` — do not edit by hand.
// Source: data/card-index.tsv, the CardIndex ledger.

//! Every card's `CardIndex`, under the constant the ledger froze for it.
//!
//! 33694 cards across 382 sets, each filed under the set it first
//! appeared in. The modules are private and globbed back out here, so a
//! caller writes `index::LIGHTNING_BOLT` and never learns which set that
//! was — which is the point, because the set is a fact about the ledger
//! and the constant is a fact about the card.
//!
//! An index is an identity and not a position: it is assigned over the
//! whole card corpus rather than over the cards this repo implements, so
//! most of these name a card no `CardDef` exists for yet. That is what
//! makes implementing an old card insert nothing.

